  "text": "So AI just killed executive assistants. Well, it killed their jobs anyway. You can now build a personal AI OS that helps you organize your tasks, manage your calendar, prepare for your appointments, and keep important follow-ups from disappearing. So here's how. First, you just give it context and instructions about who you are, what you do, and what you're responsible for. Then connect the tools where your tasks, your calendar, your messages, and documents already live. Finally, just give it workflows for things like planning your day, prepping for meetings, tracking follow-ups, things like that. And now you can tell it what you need in plain English and get help based on your actual work instead of another generic answer from an AI chatbot. It doesn't need to take a break, and it never forgets anything. So if you'd like to build your own AI OS, then click below to learn more",
